+## Safeguard regression tests
+
+```sh
+bin/rails test test/controllers/bots/message_safety_test.rb test/controllers/bots/reactivations_test.rb
+bin/rails test test/jobs/user/bot/webhook_safety_test.rb test/models/user/bot_safety_test.rb
+bin/rails test test/system/bot_safety_test.rb
+```
+
+Coverage includes rolling-window boundaries, cooldown expiry and rounding,
+concurrent posts, independent bots, combined API/webhook posting, both callback
+events, failed deliveries and all `2xx` success resets, in-flight suspension,
+preserved data and bot-limit usage, and administrator-only reactivation. The
+system tests exercise both cancelling and accepting the native confirmation.
